--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Gather Motion 3:1  (slice1; segments: 3)  (cost=0.00..431.01 rows=20 width=12) (actual time=1.342..1.347 rows=20 loops=1)
   ->  GroupAggregate  (cost=0.00..431.01 rows=7 width=12) (actual time=1.213..1.221 rows=7 loops=1)
         Group Key: d
         ->  Sort  (cost=0.00..431.01 rows=34 width=4) (actual time=1.206..1.209 rows=35 loops=1)
               Sort Key: d
               Sort Method:  quicksort  Memory: 78kB
               Executor Memory: 79kB  Segments: 3  Max: 27kB (segment 1)
               ->  Redistribute Motion 3:3  (slice2; segments: 3)  (cost=0.00..431.00 rows=34 width=4) (actual time=1.189..1.194 rows=35 loops=1)
                     Hash Key: d
                     ->  Seq Scan on smallt  (cost=0.00..431.00 rows=34 width=4) (actual time=0.010..0.015 rows=50 loops=1)
 Optimizer: Pivotal Optimizer (GPORCA)
 Planning Time: 3.349 ms
   (slice0)    Executor memory: 32K bytes.
   (slice1)    Executor memory: 46K bytes avg x 3 workers, 46K bytes max (seg1).  Work_mem: 27K bytes max.
   (slice2)    Executor memory: 111K bytes avg x 3 workers, 111K bytes max (seg0).
 Memory used:  128000kB
 Execution Time: 1.568 ms
(17 rows)

